2194 < 2 +"""Tests for the pure read-side audit query module in app/audit_query.py.
2195 < 2 +
2196 < 2 +app/audit_query.py must be pure over its `entries` argument: it takes
2197 < 2 +plain lists of entry dicts, imports nothing from app.audit, and never
2198 < 2 +mutates its input. Every test below (other than the one integration
2199 < 2 +test at the bottom) asserts the input list and its dicts are unchanged
2200 < 2 +after the call under test.
2201 < 2 +"""
